  message: "Pushed as PR #3428. CI passed. Awaiting human review and merge per --gov governance protocol (touches scripts/auto-pr + scripts/lib/forgejo-api.sh). Implementation: new find_open_tracker_sync_prs helper in forgejo-api.sh (uses Python json shim mirroring find_merged_pr; emits PR_NUM<TAB>BRANCH<TAB>CREATED_EPOCH<TAB>AGE_SECONDS rows). New _autopr_warn_orphan_tracker_sync_prs in auto-pr filters helper output to rows whose CREATED_EPOCH precedes _autopr_run_started_epoch (captured at do_pr/flush_queue entry) — surfaces orphans only, does not auto-merge, never affects exit code. Wired at both successful-merge paths (do_pr post-success and flush_queue post-success). Smoke-tested locally: helper correctly filters tracker-sync/* PRs from feature PRs; warner emits warning only for pre-cycle orphans, silent on mid-cycle creations."  # f5b4
